    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day at work, you're ready to head home. But as you step outside, time rewinds, pulling you back into the office. Everything on your desk is untouched, and your colleagues remain in place as if nothing happened. What's going on? Is this a dream? With each loop, the office begins to change...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309210/extras/dd39c792baf80a5b310668a9fc4409cd.poster.avif?t=1742234902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309210/extras/dd39c792baf80a5b310668a9fc4409cd.webm?t=1742234902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309210/extras/dd39c792baf80a5b310668a9fc4409cd.mp4?t=1742234902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deepening Layers of Fear:</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From scattered files to faint ghostly figures, the office evolves with every loop.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemies from Time:</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against monsters with clocks on their backs\u2014where do they come from?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate riddles to uncover the truth behind the time loops and escape the infinite cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this thrilling adventure where every loop brings new horrors and challenges. Will you unravel the puzzle of time, or remain trapped in the office forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309210/extras/b654af23f934d49dcccde29752a2a49d.avif?t=1742234902\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is created by <strong>@watase</strong> with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
